Drop-BAUX is a simple distributed storage system for RoxieOS.
It provides peer-to-peer file synchronization using rsync and sshfs,
designed to work with BAUX sessions for persistent data across devices.

Features:
- Distributed file storage with FUSE integration
- Peer management and synchronization
- Integration with BAUX and bvi for seamless access

